outlookkeyprog. 

Two caveats: Outlook may pop a "program is trying to access email" security prompt the first time — that's the Programmatic Access setting in Trust Center if you want to suppress it. And if you want substring matching instead of whole-word (e.g. "deposit" matching "deposition"), remove the \b anchors in the regex.

